# my-indie-studio Rules

[Project Context]
- Domain: Korea-China Cross-Border Shopping Platform (MVP)
- Monorepo Style: Apps in `apps/backend` and `apps/frontend`

[Tech Stack]
- Backend: Python 3.13, FastAPI, SQLAlchemy 2.0 (Async), Pydantic v2
- Frontend: Vue 3, TypeScript, Uni-app (Vite)
- Database: SQLite with aiosqlite (Local), PostgreSQL (Production planned)

[Code Conventions]
- Always use async/await for FastAPI database operations.
- Use Vue 3 Composition API with `<script setup lang="ts">` in frontend.
- Do NOT commit sensitive keys (.env is gitignored).
- Keep code clean and well-typed with Pydantic and TypeScript interfaces.